# Code review gate

Before merging any PR into `master`/`main`:

1. Run a Bugbot review (or equivalent security/code review) on the branch changes.
2. Fix blocking findings or document why they are accepted.
3. Add the GitHub label `code-reviewed`:
   `gh pr edit <N> --add-label code-reviewed`
4. Wait until CI jobs `test` and `review` are green.
5. Only then merge.

Do not merge without the review gate. Do not remove/bypass branch protection.
